                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When the strangleroot is first encountered, it isn't usually blood engorged. When the strangleroot uses Drain Blood, it becomes blood engorged for 1 hour or until it uses Blood Spray, whichever comes first. While blood engorged, the strangleroot turns red and loses its immunity to bleed damage.</p>"
