                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The strangleroot has a Large or smaller creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:25] save or it's pulled up to 15 feet upwards and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p>"
